 107:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_flash.c ****           To correctly read data from FLASH memory, the number of wait states (LATENCY) 
 108:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_flash.c ****           must be correctly programmed according to the frequency of the CPU clock 
 109:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_flash.c ****           (HCLK) and the supply voltage of the device.
