 613:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_flash.c ****   *                                  the operation will be done by byte (8-bit) 
 614:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_flash.c ****   *            @arg VoltageRange_2: when the device voltage range is 2.1V to 2.7V,
 615:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_flash.c ****   *                                  the operation will be done by half word (16-bit)
 616:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_flash.c ****   *            @arg VoltageRange_3: when the device voltage range is 2.7V to 3.6V,
